Arun. 209.</P> <CAPTION COM="1171">A</CAPTION> <LIST COM="1171"><ITEM>Ab ineunte aet. amp. obed. A B D 104, O 20.</ITEM> <ITEM>Ab ord. ves. de no. ap. vos scand. A B D 43, O 60.</ITEM> <ITEM>Acceptis lit. amic. mei R. Arch. A 216, B 209, C 76, G
